    <section class="hero"><div class="wrap hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="eyebrow">Company stores for promo distributors</p><h1>Your next client store.<br><em>Make it their <br>favorite place to order.</em></h1><p class="intro">We design, launch and manage branded Shopify company stores. You bring the client and the merchandise. We bring the experience.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=launch">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a><a class="quiet-link" href="#experience">Explore the experience <svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"></use></svg></a></div><div class="hero-notes"><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-palette"></use></svg>Their brand.</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield-check"></use></svg>Your client relationship.</span></div></div><div class="hero-stage"><div class="browser hero-product"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>PRODUCT ORDERING / ACTUAL DEMO</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/product-ordering.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/product-ordering-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/product-ordering.webp 1348w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 92vw, (max-width:850px) 535px, 600px" alt="Actual demo product-ordering page with merchandise options" width="1348" height="926" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="browser hero-home"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>BRANDED STOREFRONT / ACTUAL DEMO</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/branded-storefront.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/branded-storefront-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/branded-storefront.webp 1348w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 69vw, 410px" alt="Actual demo company-store homepage" width="1348" height="926" decoding="async" loading="eager" ></div><div class="stage-caption"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-mouse-pointer-2"></use></svg>A real company store. Built by Swishtag.</div></div></div></section>
<div class="service-marquee motion-region" aria-label="Company store services"><div class="wrap motion-header"><span>From the first impression to the next order.</span><button class="motion-toggle" aria-label="Pause service highlights" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pause"></use></svg><span>Pause</span></button></div><div class="marquee-viewport"><div class="marquee-track"><div class="marquee-group"><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-palette"></use></svg>Client-branded design</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg>Clearer ordering</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-settings-2"></use></svg>Ongoing store care</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"></use></svg>Rocket Apps</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-layers"></use></svg>Additional stores</span></div><div class="marquee-group" aria-hidden="true" inert><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-palette"></use></svg>Client-branded design</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg>Clearer ordering</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-settings-2"></use></svg>Ongoing store care</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"></use></svg>Rocket Apps</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-layers"></use></svg>Additional stores</span></div></div></div></div>
<section class="section value-section"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">The solution, simply</p><h2>You sell the program.<br>We make the store happen.</h2></div><p>Say yes to your next company-store opportunity without becoming a Shopify development team.</p></div><div class="value-columns"><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-palette"></use></svg><h3>Their brand. Your expertise.</h3><p>A company store that feels like your client, with your merchandise and pricing.</p></article><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg><h3>Better ordering. Less chasing.</h3><p>Collect product choices, sizes and order details in one shopping experience.</p></article><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-headphones"></use></svg><h3>A launch. And a partner.</h3><p>We build the store, then help keep it current through ongoing Care.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section experience-section" id="experience"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">See the experience</p><h2>One store.<br>Every detail considered.</h2></div><p>See how branding, product choices and approved artwork come together in our actual demo.</p></div><div class="screen-tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Choose a store screen"><button class="screen-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" id="tab-home" aria-controls="screen-panel" data-screen="home"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg><span>Storefront</span></button><button class="screen-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="true" id="tab-product" aria-controls="screen-panel" data-screen="product"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg><span>Product ordering</span></button><button class="screen-tab" role="tab" aria-selected="false" tabindex="-1" id="tab-personalization" aria-controls="screen-panel" data-screen="personalization"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-palette"></use></svg><span>Personalization</span></button></div><div class="screen-panel" id="screen-panel" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="tab-product"><div class="screen-stage"><div class="browser "><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>NORTHSTAR / PRODUCT EXPERIENCE</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/product-ordering.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/product-ordering-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/product-ordering.webp 1348w" sizes="(max-width:850px) calc(100vw - 40px), 740px" alt="Actual demo product page showing clear product choices" width="1348" height="926" decoding="async" loading="lazy" ></div><span class="actual-label">Actual Swishtag demo store</span></div><div class="screen-copy"><span class="eyebrow" id="screen-eyebrow">02 / Made for ordering</span><h3 id="screen-title">Make choosing easy.<br>Keep the details together.</h3><p id="screen-description">Clear product information, colors, sizes and ordering options in one considered product page.</p><ul class="list" id="screen-features"><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Color and size choices</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>Individual and multi-size ordering</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-circle-check"></use></svg><span>A clear next step to checkout</span></li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=store-experience">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a><small>Demo features shown. Your store is configured to the agreed scope.</small></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section concepts-section motion-region" id="possibilities"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Different clients. Different possibilities.</p><h2>A company store should<br>feel like <em>their company.</em></h2></div><div><p>From everyday team ordering to a focused client campaign. We shape the store around the program.</p><button class="motion-toggle" aria-label="Pause store concepts" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pause"></use></svg><span>Pause motion</span></button></div></div></div><div class="concepts-viewport"><div class="concept-track"><div class="concept-group"><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>ATLAS / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/atlas-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/atlas-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/atlas-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Atlas illustrative company-store design: An established team store" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>An established team store</h3><p>A complete branded storefront, with collections and a clear buying journey.</p></div></article><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>MERIDIAN / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/meridian-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/meridian-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/meridian-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Meridian illustrative company-store design: A considered welcome experience" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>A considered welcome experience</h3><p>A focused onboarding store that feels part of the client’s company.</p></div></article><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>FIELDWORK / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Fieldwork illustrative company-store design: An easier way to personalize" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>An easier way to personalize</h3><p>A product page with sizes, approved artwork and clear ordering choices.</p></div></article></div><div class="concept-group" aria-hidden="true" inert><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>ATLAS / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/atlas-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/atlas-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/atlas-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Atlas illustrative company-store design: An established team store" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>An established team store</h3><p>A complete branded storefront, with collections and a clear buying journey.</p></div></article><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>MERIDIAN / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/meridian-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/meridian-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/meridian-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Meridian illustrative company-store design: A considered welcome experience" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>A considered welcome experience</h3><p>A focused onboarding store that feels part of the client’s company.</p></div></article><article class="concept-slide"><div class="concept-browser"><div class="browser-chrome"><span><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><small>FIELDWORK / DESIGN STUDY</small><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></div><img src="/assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study.webp" srcset="/assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study-768.webp 768w, /assets/company-store/fieldwork-design-study.webp 1120w" sizes="(max-width:600px) 88vw, 520px" alt="Fieldwork illustrative company-store design: An easier way to personalize" width="1120" height="770" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></div><div class="concept-caption"><h3>An easier way to personalize</h3><p>A product page with sizes, approved artwork and clear ordering choices.</p></div></article></div></div></div><div class="wrap concept-footer"><span>Illustrative design directions · Built around each client’s scope</span><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=store-concepts">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div></section>
<section class="section care-section" id="care"><div class="wrap care-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">More than launch day</p><h2>Keep the store fresh.<br><em>Keep your team focused.</em></h2><p class="intro">Care brings together ongoing store support and your agreed Rocket Apps package. For your first store and every additional store.</p><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=care-plan">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div><div class="care-services"><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-settings-2"></use></svg><div><h3>Updates, handled.</h3><p>Product details, prices, banners and seasonal changes.</p></div></article><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"></use></svg><div><h3>Rocket Apps, included with Care.</h3><p>The agreed apps and configuration your program needs.</p></div></article><article><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-headphones"></use></svg><div><h3>A team to turn to.</h3><p>Theme and app maintenance, fixes and ongoing support.</p></div></article><p class="care-footnote">One Care Plan per store. App access requires an active subscription; the proposal confirms the package.</p></div></div></section>
<section class="section stories-section motion-region" id="client-proof"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">People behind the partnership</p><h2>Good work is noticed.<br>Great partnerships are felt.</h2></div><div><p>Published feedback from clients who have worked with Swishtag.</p><div class="story-controls"><button class="round-button" id="story-prev" aria-label="Previous client story"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-left"></use></svg></button><button class="round-button" id="story-pause" aria-label="Pause client stories" aria-pressed="false"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-pause"></use></svg></button><button class="round-button" id="story-next" aria-label="Next client story"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-right"></use></svg></button></div></div></div></div><div class="story-carousel" aria-roledescription="carousel" aria-label="Client stories"><div class="story-track"><div class="story-group"><article class="story-slide" role="group" aria-roledescription="slide" aria-label="Client feedback from Andrea Cipollone"><div class="story-media andrea"><img src="/assets/company-store/andrea-cipollone.webp" alt="Andrea Cipollone, COO, MOVOPACK" width="520" height="520" decoding="async" loading="lazy"><span class="media-label">Client perspective · Andrea Cipollone</span></div><div class="story-quote"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-quote"></use></svg><span class="eyebrow">In our client’s words</span><blockquote>“Top partner. We have worked with Swishtag for three years, and their skills and availability have exceeded our expectations.”</blockquote><div class="story-attribution"><strong>Andrea Cipollone</strong><span>COO, MOVOPACK</span></div><a class="source-link" href="#client-proof">Published client feedback <svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div></article><article class="story-slide" role="group