pan>CLIENT PERSPECTIVE</span><strong>Club<br>Colors</strong><p>Promotional products distributor</p></div></div><div class="story-quote"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-quote"></use></svg><span class="eyebrow">In our client’s words</span><blockquote>“At this point, we truly see Swishtag as an extension of our own team, and their contributions have been invaluable.”</blockquote><div class="story-attribution"><strong>Club Colors</strong><span>Promotional products distributor</span></div><a class="source-link" href="/#club-colors-story">Published client feedback <svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div></article></div></div></div><div class="wrap"><div class="story-footer"><span>Client perspectives</span><span>Real feedback. Long-term relationships.</span><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=client-proof">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div></div></section>
<section class="section pricing-section" id="pricing"><div class="wrap"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">Clear setup. Ongoing care.</p><h2>Start with one.<br>Build your next opportunity.</h2></div><p>One-time store setup, with monthly Care and Rocket Apps. Shopify and external services are paid separately.</p></div><div class="plans"><article class="plan"><span class="plan-label"><span>01 / BUILD</span><span class="plan-symbol"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shopping-bag"></use></svg></span></span><h3>First company store</h3><p class="plan-description">A branded Shopify store for one client program.</p><div class="plan-price">$1,200<small>One-time setup</small></div><p class="plan-rule">Plus $100/month Care per store</p><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Client-branded design + mobile layout</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Up to 50 products + 50 logo mockups</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Payments, shipping + launch setup</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Preview in 5 business days*</span></li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=first-store">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></article><article class="plan"><span class="plan-label"><span>02 / EXPAND</span><span class="plan-symbol"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-layers"></use></svg></span></span><h3>Additional store</h3><p class="plan-description">Launch another store from your approved template.</p><div class="plan-price">$300<small>One-time, per additional store</small></div><p class="plan-rule">Plus $100/month Care + Rocket Apps</p><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Reuse the approved design + structure</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>New location or program configuration</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Store setup + launch checks</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Typical rollout: 2–3 business days*</span></li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=additional-store">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></article><article class="plan"><span class="plan-label"><span>03 / SUPPORT</span><span class="plan-symbol"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-headphones"></use></svg></span></span><h3>Care + Rocket Apps</h3><p class="plan-description">Ongoing help for your first store and every rollout.</p><div class="plan-price">$100<small>Per month, per store</small></div><p class="plan-rule">Cancel anytime · External services separate</p><ul class="list"><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Agreed Rocket Apps package + setup</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Routine product, price + banner updates</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Theme + app maintenance and fixes</span></li><li><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-check"></use></svg><span>Support response within 1 business day</span></li></ul><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=care">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></article></div><div class="pricing-details"><details><summary>See package boundaries <svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"></use></svg></summary><p>First store: 50% deposit and 50% at launch. Additional stores reuse an approved template; different branding or custom layouts use the first-store package. Care covers routine updates, not new builds, large catalog loads or custom integrations. Merchandise, production, fulfillment, shipping, Shopify and external services are separate. *Timelines start with complete content and the deposit. The proposal confirms scope.</p></details></div><div class="rollout-estimate"><div><span class="eyebrow">Plan your rollout</span><label for="store-count">How many stores from one template?</label></div><div class="stepper"><button id="minus" aria-label="Remove one store"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-minus"></use></svg></button><input id="store-count" type="number" value="1" min="1" max="100" aria-label="Total stores"><button id="plus" aria-label="Add one store"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-plus"></use></svg></button></div><div class="estimate-results" aria-live="polite"><span><strong id="setup-total">$1,200</strong><small>one-time setup</small></span><span><strong id="care-total">$100</strong><small>Care / month</small></span></div><small class="estimate-note">Estimate: one first store + template clones. External costs excluded.</small></div></div></section>
<section class="section launch-section" id="launch"><div class="wrap launch-layout"><div><p class="eyebrow">From opportunity to open store</p><h2>A clear path <br>to launch.</h2><p class="intro">A scope you understand.<br>A preview before you commit to launch.</p><a class="button primary" href="/book-demo/?service=company-store-launch&amp;intent=launch-process">Book a demo<svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-arrow-up-right"></use></svg></a></div><ol class="launch-steps"><li><span class="step-icon"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-users"></use></svg></span><div><span class="step-label">01 / DISCOVER</span><h3>Show us the opportunity.</h3><p>Your client, their program and how orders should work.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-clipboard-check"></use></svg></span><div><span class="step-label">02 / DEFINE</span><h3>Agree the scope.</h3><p>Confirm the package, share approved assets and start the build.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg></span><div><span class="step-label">03 / PREVIEW</span><h3>See the store take shape.</h3><p>Review your branded store before it goes live.</p></div></li><li><span class="step-icon"><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-rocket"></use></svg></span><div><span class="step-label">04 / LAUNCH + CARE</span><h3>Open the store. Keep it moving.</h3><p>Complete launch checks, then stay supported through Care.</p></div></li></ol></div><div class="wrap launch-reassurance"><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-shield-check"></use></svg>Your Shopify account. Your store and data.</span><span><svg class="icon " aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-monitor"></use></svg>Design preview within 5 business days of complete content.</span>    </div></section>
